   "text": "toy: L=32, H_q=32, H_kv=8, d_h=64, FP16 (S=2), B=1  ->  2*32*8*64*2 = 65,536 B = 64 KiB / token\n100K tokens -> 6.55 GB (MHA, H_kv=32: 256 KiB/token -> 26.2 GB).  GQA shrinks ONE term; six others still scale.",
   "originalText": "toy: L=32, H_q=32, H_kv=8, d_h=64, FP16 (S=2), B=1  ->  2*32*8*64*2 = 65,536 B = 64 KiB / token\n100K tokens -> 6.55 GB (MHA, H_kv=32: 256 KiB/token -> 26.2 GB).  GQA shrinks ONE term; six others still scale.",
