   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PROBLEM: H_Q = H_K = H_V = 32: every head keeps its own K/V history. KV grows linearly\nwith context T and with batch B.",
   "originalText": "PROBLEM: H_Q = H_K = H_V = 32: every head keeps its own K/V history. KV grows linearly\nwith context T and with batch B.",
