   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): 2*32*8*64*2 B = 64 KiB/token.\n 4K  -> 256 MiB    8K -> 512 MiB\n16K  -> 1 GiB     32K ->   2 GiB\n100K -> 6.1 GiB   1M  ->  61 GiB",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): 2*32*8*64*2 B = 64 KiB/token.\n 4K  -> 256 MiB    8K -> 512 MiB\n16K  -> 1 GiB     32K ->   2 GiB\n100K -> 6.1 GiB   1M  ->  61 GiB",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
