   "text": "COST: Quantized weights risk quality; multi-GPU adds NVLink/PCIe traffic and cost.",
   "originalText": "COST: Quantized weights risk quality; multi-GPU adds NVLink/PCIe traffic and cost.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
