   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): t_decode >= KV bytes / BW. A100 1.555 TB/s: GQA-8 6.55 GB -> 4.2 ms/token;\nMHA 26.2 GB -> 16.8 ms/token; MQA 0.82 GB -> 0.53 ms.",
