   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PROBLEM: nvidia-smi says 35% util and you assume the GPU is wasted. It may simply be\nwaiting on memory: Tensor Cores idle while KV streams in.",
   "originalText": "PROBLEM: nvidia-smi says 35% util and you assume the GPU is wasted. It may simply be\nwaiting on memory: Tensor Cores idle while KV streams in.",
