   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): AI_attn ~ H_q/H_kv; P = min(P_compute, AI*BW). A100 (312 TF, 1.555 TB/s):\nMHA AI=1 -> 1.6 TF (0.5%); GQA-8 AI=4 -> 6.2 TF (2%); MQA AI=32 -> 50 TF (16%). Ridge\n~200.",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): AI_attn ~ H_q/H_kv; P = min(P_compute, AI*BW). A100 (312 TF, 1.555 TB/s):\nMHA AI=1 -> 1.6 TF (0.5%); GQA-8 AI=4 -> 6.2 TF (2%); MQA AI=32 -> 50 TF (16%). Ridge\n~200.",
