   "text": "PROBLEM: Two production metrics with different bottlenecks: you can have excellent TTFT\n with poor TPOT, or the reverse.",
   "originalText": "PROBLEM: Two production metrics with different bottlenecks: you can have excellent TTFT\n with poor TPOT, or the reverse.",
