   "text": "WHY (math): FP8 KV: 1 GB -> 0.5 GB for the same 10 GFLOPs: AI 10 -> 20. Window 128K ->\n8K: 16x fewer KV bytes AND FLOPs (AI unchanged, TPOT down). GQA-8 of 32: AI x4 on the\nKV read.",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): FP8 KV: 1 GB -> 0.5 GB for the same 10 GFLOPs: AI 10 -> 20. Window 128K ->\n8K: 16x fewer KV bytes AND FLOPs (AI unchanged, TPOT down). GQA-8 of 32: AI x4 on the\nKV read.",
