   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rule: AI < ridge -> attack MEMORY (bytes, reuse, quant).\nAI > ridge -> attack COMPUTE (Tensor Cores, precision, FLOPs).\nDecode attention stays memory-bound even with MQA (AI 32 << 200).",
   "originalText": "Rule: AI < ridge -> attack MEMORY (bytes, reuse, quant).\nAI > ridge -> attack COMPUTE (Tensor Cores, precision, FLOPs).\nDecode attention stays memory-bound even with MQA (AI 32 << 200).",
