   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): Pre-allocating max_len per request wastes internal + external\nfragmentation: old systems used only 20.4-38.2% of KV memory for real token states\n(vLLM paper).",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): Pre-allocating max_len per request wastes internal + external\nfragmentation: old systems used only 20.4-38.2% of KV memory for real token states\n(vLLM paper).",
