   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): Block = 16 tokens; Llama-3-8B block (all layers) = 16 * 128 KiB = 2 MiB.\nWaste <= block_size-1 tokens per sequence -> < 4%. 2-4x throughput vs FasterTransformer\n / Orca.",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): Block = 16 tokens; Llama-3-8B block (all layers) = 16 * 128 KiB = 2 MiB.\nWaste <= block_size-1 tokens per sequence -> < 4%. 2-4x throughput vs FasterTransformer\n / Orca.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
