   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): Sliding window: M_KV ~ W not T. W=8K vs T=128K -> 16x smaller (toy 64\nKiB/tok: 8 GiB -> 512 MiB). Also attention sinks, H2O / token eviction, KV compression,\n CPU/NVMe offload, SSM state.",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): Sliding window: M_KV ~ W not T. W=8K vs T=128K -> 16x smaller (toy 64\nKiB/tok: 8 GiB -> 512 MiB). Also attention sinks, H2O / token eviction, KV compression,\n CPU/NVMe offload, SSM state.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e323",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
