   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): No cache: 1000 * 2K = 2M prefill tokens and 1000 * 250 MiB (2000 tok * 128\nKiB) = ~244 GiB of KV. Cache: prefill 2K once, store 250 MiB once, share by ref-count.",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): No cache: 1000 * 2K = 2M prefill tokens and 1000 * 250 MiB (2000 tok * 128\nKiB) = ~244 GiB of KV. Cache: prefill 2K once, store 250 MiB once, share by ref-count.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e333",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
