   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): MHA: 32 distinct K/V per layer. GQA-8: K_1 = K_2 = K_3 = K_4 within a group\n (Q_i != Q_j). MQA: all 32 Q heads see ONE K/V.",
