   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): A_i = softmax(Q_i K^T / sqrt(d_h)) still differs per head via Q_i (K:\nB,T,1,d_h shared), but the K/V content is identical. GQA paper: MQA can degrade\nquality.",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): A_i = softmax(Q_i K^T / sqrt(d_h)) still differs per head via Q_i (K:\nB,T,1,d_h shared), but the K/V content is identical. GQA paper: MQA can degrade\nquality.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e360",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
