   "text": "WHY (math): H_kv  ratio    KV @100K (toy)\n 32   1:1 MHA   26.2 GB\n 16   2:1       13.1 GB\n  8   4:1        6.55 GB\n  4   8:1        3.28 GB\n  1   32:1 MQA   0.82 GB",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): H_kv  ratio    KV @100K (toy)\n 32   1:1 MHA   26.2 GB\n 16   2:1       13.1 GB\n  8   4:1        6.55 GB\n  4   8:1        3.28 GB\n  1   32:1 MQA   0.82 GB",
