   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY (math): Cache c^KV = W^DKV h (512) + k^R (64) = 576 elem/token/layer vs MHA\n2*n_h*d_h = 2*128*128 = 32,768 -> 1.76% (~57x). DeepSeek-V2: -93.3% KV, 5.76x\nthroughput.",
   "originalText": "WHY (math): Cache c^KV = W^DKV h (512) + k^R (64) = 576 elem/token/layer vs MHA\n2*n_h*d_h = 2*128*128 = 32,768 -> 1.76% (~57x). DeepSeek-V2: -93.3% KV, 5.76x\nthroughput.",
