   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Single most important insight: KV cache is not merely a storage problem. It is Capacity + Bandwidth + Latency + Concurrency + Scheduling + Quality at once - modern LLM architecture is about controlling information movement through the GPU memory hierarchy, not merely adding FLOPS.",
   "originalText": "Single most important insight: KV cache is not merely a storage problem. It is Capacity + Bandwidth + Latency + Concurrency + Scheduling + Quality at once - modern LLM architecture is about controlling information movement through the GPU memory hierarchy, not merely adding FLOPS.",
